 <a id="understand-the-implementation"></a>
 ## Understand the implementation
 
+An optional root-scoped `workbench` occupant registers its geometry through `ctx.layout.registerWorkbench(binding)`. On desktop it precedes the rightbar and an auxiliary main-content column; below 768px it overlays the Session region, or becomes primary while that region is collapsed. `collapseWorkbenchWhenExpanded` hides only the workbench track while the Session region is expanded. The aggregate Session region stays mounted and inert while hidden, preserving selected Session bodies and rightbar state. The root registration binds workbench and folded-landscape observables through framework hooks; `shell.bottom` remains outside the region.
+
 <details>
 <summary>Implementation internals — click to expand</summary>
 
